      ],
      "text": "Annex 2. Methods and",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.947998046875,
        258.1396789550781,
        185.54798889160156
      ],
      "text": "expert panels",
      "font": "SegoeUI",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.644287109375,
        177.52259826660156,
        250.4392852783203
      ],
      "text": "2.1 Methods",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.8903350830078,
        527.4476318359375,
        270.3333435058594
      ],
      "text": "Since 2007, the guideline development process within the WHO has been overseen by the WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.0902099609375,
        527.4234619140625,
        283.5332336425781
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines Review Committee (GRC), which follows internationally recognized standards such as the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.29022216796875,
        527.4759521484375,
        296.7332458496094
      ],
      "text": "GRADE approach [Grading of Recommendations Assessment, Development, and Evaluation], to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.490234375,
        527.434326171875,
        309.9332580566406
      ],
      "text": "support a structured and transparent methodology for policy-making. The policy recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.690185546875,
        527.584716796875,
        323.1332092285156
      ],
      "text": "presented in the guideline document were developed following the standards and updated procedures",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94491195678711,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.89019775390625,
        369.41717529296875,
        336.3332214355469
      ],
      "text": "as described in the WHO Handbook for Guideline Development.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.5941162109375,
        527.125,
        358.0371398925781
      ],
      "text": "A WHO Guideline Steering Group was first established to determine specific areas requiring up-to-date",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949584007263184,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.7942199707031,
        527.4356079101562,
        371.23724365234375
      ],
      "text": "evidence and to carry out arrangements to bring together experts to synthesize and independently",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.99420166015625,
        527.4288330078125,
        384.4372253417969
      ],
      "text": "review new evidence and develop recommendations. An external review group was also assembled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.194091796875,
        527.3989868164062,
        397.6371154785156
      ],
      "text": "to review the updated recommendations based on the inputs of the Guideline Development Group.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.3941955566406,
        527.6137084960938,
        410.83721923828125
      ],
      "text": "The Guideline Development Group comprises researchers, epidemiologists, end-users (clinicians and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991796493530273,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.5941162109375,
        527.3748168945312,
        424.0371398925781
      ],
      "text": "national TB control programme officers), community representatives, and experts in evidence synthesis.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9464693069458,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.7942199707031,
        527.1238403320312,
        437.23724365234375
      ],
      "text": "In compliance with the procedures and practices established by the GRC, declarations of interest (DOI)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969056129455566,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.99420166015625,
        527.556396484375,
        450.4372253417969
      ],
      "text": "were managed according to the WHO Conflict of Interest Policy, including a review of curriculum vitae",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979180335998535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.194091796875,
        527.429931640625,
        463.6371154785156
      ],
      "text": "and critical evaluation of DOI. Additionally, contingent on the assessment of competing interests, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.3941955566406,
        527.4146118164062,
        476.83721923828125
      ],
      "text": "full list of members of the Guideline Development Group and their biographies were published on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.5941162109375,
        527.4234008789062,
        490.0371398925781
      ],
      "text": "the WHO website. This was followed by a public notice and comment period, during which WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.7942199707031,
        527.3991088867188,
        503.23724365234375
      ],
      "text": "allowed members of the public to provide comments pertinent to any interests that may have gone",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.99420166015625,
        317.2254333496094,
        516.4371948242188
      ],
      "text": "unnoticed or not reported during earlier assessments.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        523.6981201171875,
        527.53857421875,
        538.14111328125
      ],
      "text": "During the virtual Guideline Development Group meeting, the members of the GDG reached decisions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.956865310668945,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        536.8980712890625,
        527.4025268554688,
        551.341064453125
      ],
      "text": "through a process of discussion and consensus. Where consensus through discussion could not be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        550.09814453125,
        527.4068603515625,
        564.5411376953125
      ],
      "text": "reached, the GDG voted on decisions. In these cases, decisions were made based on the vote of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.298095703125,
        112.32398223876953,
        577.7410888671875
      ],
      "text": "majority.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.09130859375,
        334.82928466796875,
        611.9713134765625
      ],
      "text": "Preparation for evidence assessment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.1751708984375,
        527.2077026367188,
        632.6181640625
      ],
      "text": "The GRADE approach (Grading of Recommendations Assessment, Development, and Evaluation)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.3751831054688,
        527.4266357421875,
        645.8181762695312
      ],
      "text": "was used to rate the certainty in the estimate of effect (quality of evidence) as high, moderate, low,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        644.5753173828125,
        527.236328125,
        659.018310546875
      ],
      "text": "or very low and to determine the strength of the recommendations (as strong or conditional). A",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        657.7752685546875,
        527.4177856445312,
        672.21826171875
      ],
      "text": "scoping proposal was submitted and approved by the WHO Guideline Review Committee. Details",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        670.975341796875,
        527.5294189453125,
        685.4183349609375
      ],
      "text": "about the preparatory work ahead of the update were released to the public through public comment,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.958521842956543,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        684.1751708984375,
        527.4058837890625,
        698.6181640625
      ],
      "text": "focusing on the following: (i) rationale for providing up-to-date guidance, including the scope of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        697.3751831054688,
        527.3969116210938,
        711.8181762695312
      ],
      "text": "the updates; (ii) prioritization and formulation of key questions; as well as (iii) the list, affiliations, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        710.5753173828125,
        527.4124145507812,
        725.018310546875
      ],
      "text": "constituencies of potential members of the Guideline Development Group, undergoing conflict of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        723.7753295898438,
        527.4003295898438,
        738.2183227539062
      ],
      "text": "interest assessments, as per the WHO Office of Compliance, Risk Management and Ethics policies.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        736.9752807617188,
        527.4232788085938,
        751.4182739257812
      ],
      "text": "In preparation for the Guideline Development Group meeting, four webinars (via Zoom) were held",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        750.1752319335938,
        527.5932006835938,
        764.6182250976562
      ],
      "text": "with members of the Group to finalize the scoping and PICO (Patients, Intervention, Comparator and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992197036743164,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "250 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
